<title>FRANCE: SCOR reorganises Italian subsidiary.</title>
<headline>SCOR reorganises Italian subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French re-insurance group SCOR said on Monday it was reorganising its Italian activities and would transfer all its life and non-life activities in that country to its 100-percent owned unit Vittoria Riassicurazioni.</p>
<p>Vittoria will be renamed SCOR Italia Riassicurazioni.</p>
<p>SCOR said the move completed the reorganisation of its European operations.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
